WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.069
&gt;&gt;&gt; THE HOUSE SECT COMMITTEE
IS PREPARING FOR ITS NEXT ROUND

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:06.539
