WITNESSES, ALONG WITH VIDEOS,

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:14.480
TEXTS, E-MAILS, AND OTHER
DOCUMENTS.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.817
THE COMMITTEE'S CHAIRMAN SAYS
THE GOAL IS TO RESTART HEARINGS

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:21.121
ON SEPTEMBER 28th.
JOINING ME NOW IS COMMITTEE

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:24.557
MEMBER, JAMIE RASKIN, DEMOCRATIC
CONGRESSMAN FROM MARYLAND.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.359
