&gt;&gt; WELL, THE MEETING IS AT LEAST

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:48.448
PROVISIONALLY SCHEDULED FOR
SEPTEMBER 28th AND WE'RE HOPING

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:54.087
WE'LL BE ABLE TO DO THE HEARING
ON THE 28th OF SEPTEMBER.

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:58.858
AND, YOU KNOW, THIS IS A HEARING
WHERE I HOPE THAT WE WILL BE

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:03.263
